## Issue tracking system

Every issue worked on has a directory at `issues/<nid>/`. These directories survive across sessions — they are the long-term memory for contribution work.

```
issues/
└── 3456789/
    ├── README.md         ← persistent record: summary, work log, human notes
    └── screenshots/      ← Playwright screenshots
```

### Key workflow rules

1. **`/drupal-issue-start <url>` is the only entry point.** Never invoke `drupal-issue-agent` directly.
2. The issue record is always created/read **before** any work begins.
3. After every session, **`/issue-record-update <nid>`** logs what was done.
4. Screenshots go in `issues/<nid>/screenshots/` via **`/issue-record-screenshot`**.

