## Mem0 persistent memory

This project uses the **mem0ai plugin** for Claude Code to provide semantic memory across sessions. It stores decisions, open items, and session summaries searchable by any future AI session.

### Setup

```
/plugin marketplace add mem0ai/mem0
/plugin install mem0@mem0-plugins
/reload-plugins
```

Get your API key from `https://app.mem0.ai/dashboard/api-keys` and set it in the Desktop app environment editor (environment dropdown → "Local" → gear icon):
```
MEM0_API_KEY = m0-your-key-here
```

Run `/mem0:onboard` once after setting the key.

### Identity

Every mem0 call must include:
- `user_id`: your mem0 user ID
- `app_id`: `{{DDEV_PROJECT}}`

### What happens automatically

| Event | Action |
|---|---|
| Session start | `CLAUDE.md` imported into mem0; coding categories applied |
| `/drupal-issue-start <url>` | Phase 1b searches mem0 for prior context on the issue NID |
| `/issue-record-update <nid>` | Step 8 stores a compact session summary in mem0 |
| `drupal-issue-agent` Phase 0 | Searches mem0 for the issue NID before any context gathering |

### Key mem0 skills

| Skill | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `/mem0:onboard` | First-time setup wizard |
| `/mem0:tour` | Show everything mem0 knows about this project |
| `/mem0:remember` | Manually store a memory |
| `/mem0:peek` | Quick search without full tour |

