## Skills and agents

Custom Claude Code skills live in `.claude/skills/`. The main agent is `.claude/agents/drupal-issue-agent.md`.

### Entry point skills
- `drupal-issue-start` — **PRIMARY ENTRY POINT**: load/create issue record, fetch live context, present report, wait for human direction
- `issue-record-update` — append timestamped session log to `issues/<nid>/README.md`
- `issue-record-screenshot` — capture Playwright screenshot into `issues/<nid>/screenshots/`

### Other key skills
- `drupal-work-on-issue` — fork setup, remote, checkout, push, pipeline loop
- `drupal-review-issue` — diff review, inline thread analysis, checklist
- `drupal-gitlab-inline-comments` — fetch MR inline threads and issue notes
- `drupal-coding-standards` — PHPCS/PHPCBF with module config detection
- `drupalorg-cli` — reference stub for `drupalorg` command usage
